## Real-World Example: GitHub Repository Report

[](#real-world-example-github-repository-report)

The [GitHubRepo](/richlander/markout/blob/main/samples/GitHubRepo) sample fetches four GitHub API endpoints in parallel and projects the combined JSON into a single report — fields, bar charts, contributor metrics, and release tables — all from one model:

\[MarkoutSerializable(TitleProperty \= nameof(Title), DescriptionProperty \= nameof(Description))\]
public class RepoInfo
{
    public string Title { get; set; } \= "";

    \[MarkoutIgnore\]
    public string Description { get; set; } \= "";

